OL,3,GNEWSAWrongful imprisonment was 'like a
OL,4,Akangaroo court'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cleaner who spent a week in prison
OL,7,Fafter being wrongfully accused of
OL,8,Fsparking anti-immigration disorder in
OL,9,FThetford has told the BBC he has "run
OL,10,Fout of tears" over the ordeal.
OL,12,FAddresses on five streets in the
OL,13,FNorfolk town were targeted by crowds
OL,14,Fover three nights in August, prompting
OL,15,Fviolent scenes which saw asylum seekers
OL,16,Fescorted from houses by police.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
