OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWrongful imprisonment was 'like a
OL,4,Akangaroo court'
OL,5,
OL,6,FJames Jobson, from Highlow Road in
OL,7,FCostessey, near Norwich, was charged
OL,8,Fwith misconduct in public office after
OL,9,Fbeing accused of sharing the addresses
OL,10,Fof the properties and spent seven days
OL,11,Fin Norwich Prison, before the charges
OL,12,Fwere dropped.
OL,14,FJobson, worked as a cleaner for Home
OL,15,FOffice contractor Serco, cleaning
OL,16,Fproperties across East Anglia which
OL,17,Fwere used to house asylum seekers.
